================================================================================
1. What this product distributes
================================================================================

Two artifacts leave a developer machine, and they carry different third-party
content. Section 4 turns on that difference, so it is recorded here first.

  vodoge-cloud-gateway   A Go binary built from apps/gateway. The modules in
                         section 2 are compiled into it.

  vodoge-cloud-console   A Next.js standalone bundle built from apps/console.
                         The packages in section 3 are part of it. Whether the
                         packages in section 4 are part of it depends on which
                         of the two recipes in deploy/ produced it.

Both run in container images built FROM alpine:3.22 and node:22-alpine, and the
Compose project also runs stock postgres:18.4-alpine and redis:8.8.0-alpine.
The contents of those base images are third-party software under their own
licenses. They are not redistributed by this repository and are not covered by
this NOTICE.


