  @img/colour                       1.1.0   MIT         Copyright (c) 2012 Heather Arthur; republished by Lovell Fuller
  @emnapi/runtime                   1.11.3  MIT         a dependency of @img/sharp-wasm32
  detect-libc                       2.1.2   Apache-2.0  published by Lovell Fuller
  semver                            7.8.5   ISC         Copyright (c) Isaac Z. Schlueter and Contributors

The `@next/swc-*` binaries are the Next.js compiler; they run on the machine
that builds the console. Note that they are pinned at 15.5.7 while `next`
itself is 15.5.10 -- that is what the lockfile resolves, not a typo here.

The last 84 entries are marked `dev`: TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, PostCSS and its
plugins, the type definitions, and their transitive dependencies. They run on
the machine that builds the console and are not part of either artifact, so
they are not attributed individually. Their licenses, as recorded in
